Shateroo, forest.
[wait time="1.0"]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/Forest_day.png" fade="0.0"]
audio BGS "res://assets/audio/sfx/Forest - sound.wav" [loop="true"]
audio music "res://assets/audio/music/Town_road_bgm.wav"
if {CharaMeeting.meet_vlad} == false:
	Narrator: Near the trees in the forest, a thin weird man sits alone.
	join Vlad (Vlad_normal) center
	catherine: Um, hello. Sorry to bother you ?
	Vlad (Vlad_confused): Oh. Um. N-no, not really, I am Vlad. But who are you? I've never seen you around town.
	Vlad (Vlad_confused): And what are you doing here ?
	set {CharaMeeting.meet_vlad} = true
else:
	join Vlad (Vlad_normal) center
	catherine: *Screams* Oh, an ugly man.
	Vlad (Vlad_confused): *Astonished and a little bit hurt* Oh God! What ? Again ...what are you doing here?
catherine: You look hella scary ? Should I hide from you or something ?
Vlad (Vlad_angry): Absolutely not, but you are quite brave, despite how frail you look. You know wild animals could kill you here.
catherine: It's not the wild animals that are worrying me.
Vlad (Vlad_sad): Still looking for hum, monsters *cough*. Are you?
- Admit you are still looking but will do it alone.
	catherine: Yes, I am still looking. But I already saw 2 of them earlier. So I will find what I am searching for.
	Vlad (Vlad_confused): You are .. admirable. No, not admirable. Crazy.
	Vlad (Vlad_happy): Yes, you are crazy.
	Vlad: I don't wanna deal with crazy people looking for monsters... and trouble.
	leave Vlad
	set {EndingTracking.catherine_sympathy} -= 1.0
- Ask for more information.
	catherine: You seem to know a lot about them. Why won't you tell me more?
	Vlad (Vlad_normal): You say I am an ugly man and then you patronize me. You're such a little brat. Even if you almost look like a ghost.
	catherine: I would have looked better if you had helped me from the start.
	Vlad (Vlad_talk): Fine, well.. listen. Every move you make in this is tracked by the creatures you met earlier.
	Vlad (Vlad_happy): Once you said outloud that you wanted to meet... whatever, I assure you he knows that.
	Vlad (Vlad_happy): And if you are "interesting" enough, he will come find you. Trust me.
	Vlad (Vlad_normal): So, just be patient.
	catherine: You just tell me to wait for someone to approach me?
	Vlad (Vlad_talk): YES.
	catherine: Every encounter I had was random anyway so I don't really have a choice. I am still going to wander around while waiting. Vlad.
	Vlad (Vlad_happy): Yes, that's it. Now you, go away before the ugly man eats you.. or something.
	catherine: Haha, very funny.
	leave Vlad
	set {EndingTracking.catherine_sympathy} += 1.0
